## Kimi CLI Integration

### MCP Tools
Kimi CLI supports Model Context Protocol (MCP) for tool integration. If MCP tools are configured:
- Use `--mcp-config-file` to specify MCP configuration
- Tools are available during conversation for enhanced capabilities

### ACP Integration
For IDE integration, Kimi CLI supports Agent Client Protocol (ACP):
- Enables integration with editors like VS Code
- Provides file editing and navigation capabilities

